        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-painter-chemotactic-stripe-splitting-measurement-chi-0-sensitivity-sweep-1e-5-1e-4-1e-3-spearman-monotonicity-of-stripe-contrast-with-chi-0>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-painter-chemotactic-stripe-splitting-measurement-curved-surface-spindle-k-0-final-stripe-count-at-s-5-2-vs-kondo-asai-doubling-law>,
