<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-painter-chemotactic-stripe-splitting-measurement-curved-surface-spindle-k-0-final-stripe-count-at-s-5-2-vs-kondo-asai-doubling-law> a schema:PropertyValue,
