<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-painter-chemotactic-stripe-splitting-measurement-slime-trail-shifted-chemotactic-threshold-chi-c-m-predicted-by-law-6-vs-simulated-onset-bracket> a schema:PropertyValue,
