    rdfs:comment "observed/quasi-static = 1.727; iridophores accumulate at u minima because chi_0 < 0 (repellent). The ratio exceeds 1 because the slow cells (D_n = 5e-4) are swept by the moving u peaks during the 6 -> 12 splitting at s = 4.44, so n is not quasi-static at s = 5.2; same-order agreement is the tested quantity" ;
