    dct:source "simulated onset bracket: ridges held at chi = 4.4 are sustained with trails (amp > 0.3) but decay at chi = 4.0; midpoint of the bracket. Balagam & Igoshin (2015) PLoS Comput Biol 11:e1004474 slime trails as orientation memory" ;
    rdfs:comment "sustained_with_trails = {4.0: False, 4.4: True}, decays_without_trails = {4.0: True, 4.4: True}; Lean slime_trail_anisotropic_mobility_lowers_chemotactic_threshold" ;
